FURB145 [*] Prefer `copy` method over slicing
 --> FURB145.py:4:5
  |
3 | # Errors.
4 | a = l[:]
  |     ^^^^
5 | b, c = 1, l[:]
6 | d, e = l[:], 1
  |
help: Replace with `copy()`
  |
4 - a = l[:]
4 + a = l.copy()
  |

